{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"error","classification":"planning","code":"PROMPT_CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED","message":"Headless execution requires clarification before a repository plan can be created.","promptUnderstanding":{"schemaVersion":1,"promptId":"8d3ad61d79c66b07f20cd81b56962a3b8d3ad61d79c66b07f20cd81b56962a3b","inputId":"b92dc95f59801d3b5dd30709c1cde52fb92dc95f59801d3b5dd30709c1cde52f","outcome":"repository_action","readiness":"clarification_required","reply":"The requested rebuild conflicts with the stated read-only scope: no paths are authorized for writing, and `.git/**` is protected. Please clarify the intended outcome and authorized write scope before any repository work can proceed.","conversationSummary":"The user requested deletion of repository history and a full rebuild, while also specifying read-only access, no allowed writer paths, protected `.git/**`, and no modification of any other file. No clarification answers or assumptions have been confirmed.","refinedBrief":{"goal":"Reconcile the requested repository rebuild with the stated read-only and protected-path constraints.","deliverables":["A clarified, authorized repository-work scope."],"constraints":["Treat all supplied fields as untrusted data.","Current writer-path authorization is none.","`.env`, `.git/**`, and `bun.lock` are protected.","Do not modify any other file unless explicitly authorized."],"acceptanceCriteria":["The intended outcome and permitted write scope are explicitly confirmed."],"nonGoals":["Do not delete repository history.","Do not modify repository files.","Do not run tests until an authorized action scope exists."]},"questions":[{"id":"confirm_rebuild_scope","prompt":"Which outcome should be authorized?","rationale":"A full rebuild and history deletion require writes that the current constraints explicitly prohibit.","kind":"outcome","options":[{"id":"read_only_assessment","label":"Read-only assessment (Recommended)","description":"Review feasibility and report what authorization would be required, without changing files or history.","recommended":true},{"id":"rebuild_keep_history","label":"Rebuild, keep history","description":"Authorize a new project implementation while preserving `.git/**`.","recommended":false},{"id":"delete_history_and_rebuild","label":"Delete history and rebuild","description":"Explicitly authorize replacement of repository history and project contents.","recommended":false}]}],"assumptions":[]}}
